[CHANGE] benchmark_6/parts/semver_solver/tests/semver_solver_impl_test.py: Authored comprehensive unit tests for VersionEngine, PackageRepository, and DependencySolver: SemVer parse/format/leading-zero grammar, precedence tri-state chain and prerelease/build-metadata rules, range parsing (comparators, caret/tilde, wildcard, hyphen, union, whitespace) with contracted InvalidRangeError branches, satisfies matching including wildcard expansions and prerelease filtering, repository registration ordering/membership/all_packages/PackageNotFoundError/copy semantics, and solver highest-precedence, transitive merging, backtracking, conflict, and missing-package resolution outcomes.
[CHANGE] benchmark_6/parts/semver_solver/pretense/semver_solver_pretense.py: Implemented the SemVer solver interface pretense state machine: concrete model state (version/range lookup oracles, release catalog, dependency options), 1:1 transitions for Version.format/is_prerelease, VersionEngine parse/compare/range/satisfies, PackageRepository register/get/has/all, and DependencySolver.resolve with concrete inner-transition return oracles and a seeding transition; added fixed fake scenarios covering every transition and seeding transition plus the compiled fake Hypothesis case.
[CHANGE] benchmark_6/parts/semver_solver/pretense/semver_solver_impl_pretense.py: Implemented the SemVer solver implementation pseudo-state machine: inner-transition overrides delegating to the concrete VersionEngine/PackageRepository/DependencySolver singletons via call_target with no new state classes, transitions, or require_arg; added TestSemverSolverImplReal scenario suites covering version parsing (valid/pre-release/build + contracted InvalidVersionError branches), precedence ordering, range parsing forms plus InvalidRangeError branches, satisfies comparator/prerelease filtering, repository registration/ordering/membership/enumeration plus PackageNotFoundError, and resolver success plus ResolutionConflictError; bound the real Hypothesis fuzz case to the concrete aggregate SUT.
[CHANGE] benchmark_6/parts/semver_solver/lib/semver_solver.py: Initialize the semver_solver interface module: define SemVerError/InvalidVersionError/InvalidRangeError/ResolutionConflictError/PackageNotFoundError as non-frozen dataclass exceptions with __str__ delegation, ComparatorOp enum, frozen @data_type records (Version with is_prerelease/format/__str__, VersionRange, PackageDependency, PackageRelease, ResolutionOutcome), and @poly_type Protocol services (VersionEngine, PackageRepository, DependencySolver) with @operation stubs matching low/semver_solver.pyi.
[CHANGE] benchmark_6/parts/semver_solver/lib/semver_solver_impl.py: Implement the semver_solver_impl module: VersionEngine with SemVer 2.0.0 regex parsing (leading-zero/grammar errors raise InvalidVersionError), tri-state precedence comparison ignoring build metadata, range parsing that trims text and rejects empty/whitespace/comma/empty-union/bare-partial/malformed inputs via InvalidRangeError, and satisfies() compiling ranges to DNF with comparator, caret, tilde, wildcard, hyphen, and union expansion plus prerelease filtering/targeting; PackageRepository storing _packages with precedence-descending sorted releases, PackageNotFoundError, copy-on-read, membership and name-set queries using get_singleton(VersionEngine); DependencySolver performing MRV backtracking search with descending candidate ordering, constraint accumulation/rollback, missing-package tolerance, and ResolutionConflictError with conflicting packages and derivation explanation.
